{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draw. Play. Laugh.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draw &amp; Play</strong> is a creative 2D platformer where you bring your own levels to life by drawing them!<br>Sketch platforms, add doodle obstacles, place funny enemies\u2026 then instantly test your ideas. Everything is fast, fun, and accessible: your imagination is the only limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>How does it work?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Draw &amp; Play</strong>, everything feels like an interactive sketchbook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u270f\ufe0f Draw platforms and obstacles directly on the screen.<br>\ud83d\udc7e Place static or tricky enemies to spice up the challenge.<br>\ud83c\udfae Test your level instantly with your doodle character.<br>\ud83c\udf0d Share your creations via Steam Workshop and explore levels from other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is unique, because every player can invent their own challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u270f\ufe0f Intuitive doodle editor \u2013 sketch platforms and obstacles freely.<br>\ud83d\udc7e Funny enemies \u2013 add doodles to surprise players.<br>\ud83c\udfae Instant play \u2013 jump from creation to action in one click.<br>\ud83c\udf0d Share &amp; explore \u2013 publish your levels or try those from the community.<br>\ud83d\udcd3 Unique style \u2013 a playful, colorful sketchbook universe accessible to everyone.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4047980?t=1760523017","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4047980?t=1760523017","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047980/8eafea1bc033a78e7013eed8c34ab06427e7f781/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760523017","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.ste